# Mystery Gift unlocked as on the DS (docs/decisions.md "Mystery Gift with gift codes"): Jubilife TV 3F's
# questionnaire (decomp JubilifeTV3F_GymGuide2). YES, then the Easy Chat word picker twice (choose_two_custom_message_words):
# EVERYONE HAPPY (PEOPLE, FEELINGS), then WI-FI CONNECTION (UNION, twice). The wallpaper passwords are not checked
# (get_wallpaper_from_custom_message_words stays a stub: no wallpaper), so check_is_mystery_gift_phrase compares with
# the ROM's own phrase and unlock_mystery_gift sets the save's flag (`mysteryGift.unlocked`). A wrong answer first
# (EVERYONE HAPPY, HAPPY EVERYONE): thanks, nothing unlocked.
party 0 platinum:SPECIES_TURTWIG 10 platinum:MOVE_TACKLE
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_JUBILIFE_TV_3F 10 14 down
until idle
+0 press a
+1 release a
advance text
until yesno
+0 press a
+1 release a
until app easy-chat
+1 tap slot:0
+1 tap group:4
+1 tap word:platinum:PeopleWords_Text_Everyone
+1 tap slot:1
+1 tap group:7
+1 tap word:platinum:Feelings_Text_Happy
+1 tap yes
until app none
until message
+0 assert text platinum:JubilifeTV3F_Text_WhatFeedbackCanYouGive 0
advance text
+0 assert app easy-chat
+1 tap slot:0
+1 tap group:7
+1 tap word:platinum:Feelings_Text_Happy
+1 tap slot:1
+1 tap group:4
+1 tap word:platinum:PeopleWords_Text_Everyone
+1 tap yes
until app none
until message
+0 assert text platinum:JubilifeTV3F_Text_ThanksForAnsweringMyQuestion 0
advance text
until idle
# The phrase: EVERYONE HAPPY, WI-FI CONNECTION.
+0 press a
+1 release a
advance text
until yesno
+0 press a
+1 release a
until app easy-chat
+1 tap slot:0
+1 tap group:4
+1 tap word:platinum:PeopleWords_Text_Everyone
+1 tap slot:1
+1 tap group:7
+1 tap word:platinum:Feelings_Text_Happy
+1 tap yes
until app none
until message
advance text
+0 assert app easy-chat
+1 tap slot:0
+1 tap group:9
+1 tap word:platinum:UnionWords_Text_WiFi
+1 tap slot:1
+1 tap group:9
+1 tap word:platinum:UnionWords_Text_Connection
+1 tap yes
until app none
until message
+0 assert text platinum:JubilifeTV3F_Text_DealForMysteryGift 0
advance text
until idle
+0 assert state mysteryGift.unlocked true
+0 reload
until idle
+0 assert state mysteryGift.unlocked true
